# "simple" in S3 (a simple life) and S5 (a more simple way of living) both mean a plain, unluxurious way of life opposed to "delicate and over-careful living", so god_wishes_simple and soil_simple share one sense.
# A1 links "very little effort" to "simple life". These are two different claims, each in its own sense, and "simple" does not occur in A1's antecedent, so A1 is not a bridge.
